mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微信支付发布AI专属卡，支持Agent闭环消费并实现主账户完全隔离</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">SpaceX宣布以600亿美元全股票方式收购AI编程初创公司Cursor</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic企业市场份额首超OpenAI，Claude Opus 4.8成核心驱动力</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱AI正式开源GLM-5.2模型，支持1M无损上下文与长程代码任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/18e55318c993f87adf34e8366570881d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智谱AI正式发布并开源新一代大模型GLM-5.2，该模型核心聚焦Coding能力与长程任务执行。在Code Arena评估中，GLM-5.2位列全球可用模型第二、开源模型第一。技术层面，该模型实现了1M无损上下文，通过扩展Coding Agent训练环境解决了长文本劣化问题，在FrontierSWE基准测试中性能表现优异。工程应用方面，GLM-5.2支持单次处理高达88万tokens，可自主完成多端应用全链路开发，并引入思考档位（effort level）控制以提升编程评测表现。架构上，通过IndexShare架构将1M上下文下的单位token FLOPs降至2.9倍，并改进MTP层以优化投机解码效率。目前，GLM-5.2已基于MIT协议在Hugging Face和ModelScope开源，并完成与华为昇腾、平</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软Copilot Cowork拟转向按量计费，或引入Azure托管版DeepSeek V4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9995ca828e3c78d065a32073fdf6f426.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软Copilot Cowork拟转向按量计费，或引入Azure托管版DeepSeek V4AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 17, 2026196月16日，微软被曝正考虑在其Copilot Cowork中推出基于DeepSeek V4的自托管优化版本，以提供更经济的模型选择，同时该产品的定价模式也将全面转向按使用量计费。随着智能体推理任务的爆发式增长，Copilot Cowork此前采用的Anthropic Claude技术因高度依赖复杂推理，导致Token消耗量剧增。微软执行副总裁Charles Lamanna透露，原有固定费率的定价模式在用户每周执行数百项任务的重度使用场景下已不可持续，高昂的运营成本正迅速推高。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信支付发布AI专属卡，支持Agent闭环消费并实现主账户完全隔离</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e74f3ca8cfc1b28904026b867e952ad3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月17日，微信支付正式发布专为AI Agent设计的“AI专属卡”，旨在解决智能体落地过程中的支付资金流难题。该产品已率先在Mac端5.1.1版本的WorkBuddy平台上线，用户可通过“美团生活助手”实现从智能推荐、下单到支付的全链路闭环。针对安全风险，微信支付采用“主账隔离”架构，AI专属卡独立于微信支付主账户，Agent仅能调取卡内有限余额。此外，卡内额度支持灵活转入转出，且每笔订单执行前均需用户本人授权确认。这一“办事钱包”模式赋予了Agent离线资金调配能力，标志着AI生态从单纯的信息获取向服务消费商业化闭环迈进。未来，该功能将向更多Agent平台开放，加速AI向具身智能与行动智能演进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX宣布以600亿美元全股票方式收购AI编程初创公司Cursor</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d8495333cc73fd708a9f4b2acf78a186.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX正式敲定以600亿美元全股票交易收购AI编程初创公司Cursor，其母公司Anysphere将于今年第三季度成为SpaceX全资子公司。该收购协议始于今年4月，随着SpaceX近期上市后市值突破2万亿美元，马斯克果断行使收购选择权。此次交易旨在强化SpaceX在AI辅助编程领域的布局，通过整合Cursor的AI代码生成技术及开发者社群，缩小与OpenAI、Anthropic等行业领头羊的差距。此前SpaceX已完成与xAI的合并，此次收购进一步将火箭发射、卫星互联网与AI基础设施整合至统一架构。对于行业而言，此举标志着SpaceX将企业级AI应用作为长期增长核心引擎，通过资本运作加速构建涵盖前沿AI技术的垂直生态。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic企业市场份额首超OpenAI，Claude Opus 4.8成核心驱动力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">金融科技平台Ramp数据显示，Anthropic在企业AI订阅市场的份额已达41%，首次超越OpenAI的39.5%。尽管Anthropic因美国政府出口管制被迫撤出Mythos 5和Fable 5模型，并面临非美籍员工接触核心技术的限制，但其企业端业务表现强劲。5月底发布的Claude Opus 4.8模型成为企业客户采购的核心主力，在API接口调用和编程服务领域表现突出。分析指出，美国政府以“安全风险”为由的监管举措，反而被市场视为其技术实力强悍的背书，极大提升了企业客户信心。尽管与白宫的冲突可能影响其IPO进程，但Anthropic在企业级赛道的商业影响力已达到顶峰，成功在逆风环境下实现市场份额反超。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
